    org: "MOX BANK — VIRTUAL BANKING — HONG KONG",
    body: "Release champion for the iOS/Android app, leading cross-team coordination and release risk. As Team Lead, ran technical sign-offs across 10+ product teams and mentored engineers. On-call owner for the GraphQL gateway (incidents, RCA, observability). Led React Native for customer onboarding, reducing crash rates.",
  },
  {
    when: "2018–2019",
    role: "Software Engineer",
    org: "COVERGO — INSURTECH — HONG KONG",
    body: "Led a React Native app for a major banking client; built flows and integrations on a multi-tenant insurance platform.",
  },
  {
    when: "2018",
